#. js-lingui-id: D5Kf4t
msgid "Tuesday your team learns that deals with a technical champion close 3x faster. Wednesday you add the field, wire up the scoring, adjust the workflow. By Thursday your agents are acting on it. That feedback loop is the edge. And it only works if the CRM is yours."
